# Commits that changed formatting only, and should never be the answer to
# "who wrote this line?".
#
# GitHub reads this file automatically in its blame view. Local git needs to be
# told once — the `prepare` script in package.json does it, so `npm install`
# is the only setup step. By hand:
#
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Add a SHA here ONLY if the commit is purely mechanical. A commit that mixes
# formatting with a real change must not be listed: ignoring it would hide the
# real change too.

